<div><h3>${R("ChatGPT i Claude, kter\xE9 u\u017E plat\xEDte","The ChatGPT and Claude you already pay for")}</h3><p>${R("\u017D\xE1dn\xFD nov\xFD n\xE1stroj na nau\u010Den\xED. T\xFDm se pt\xE1 tam, kde u\u017E pracuje; na ChatGPT Team nebo Enterprise konektor povol\xED spr\xE1vce.","No new tool to learn. The team asks where it already works; on ChatGPT Team or Enterprise an admin allows the connector.")}</p></div>
